        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Graphic Design - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Refactoring is editing. You do not add features when you refactor; you remove\nuntil the structure clarifies. Dead code elimination, extracting a function,\ncollapsing a class hierarchy — each operation reduces surface area so the\nremaining code carries more meaning per line."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#014",
